## Purpose

Provides a simplified, read-only summary of applicant records for dashboards, search, reporting, and review interfaces. It exposes the most commonly accessed applicant information, AI evaluation, and workflow status from the `intake` table.

---

## Source Tables

| Table | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `intake` | Primary applicant information and AI evaluation data. |

---

