## Why This View Exists

The `intake` table contains over 150 fields covering applicant information, AI analysis, workflow, auditing, and processing metadata. Most user interfaces only require a subset of these fields.

This view provides a clean, lightweight representation that simplifies queries, reduces data transfer, and serves as the primary dataset for dashboards and reporting.